ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 36215, Mar. 24, 2026>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on March 26, 2026; provided, the provisions of Articles 18 through 20 shall enter into force on March 26, 2027.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning standards for designation and entrustment of dedicated organizations)
An institution that performs a pilot project relating to dedicated support for children or youth in crisis under Article 28 of the Act as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed to have been designated or entrusted as having met the standards for designation and entrustment of a dedicated organization under Article 22 of the Act and Article 13(1) of this Decree; provided, an institution that does not meet the qualification standards under Article 13(1)1b and subparagraph 2 of Appendix 2 shall meet such standards within 3 years from the date this Decree enters into force.
